Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.30,0:00:07.87,Dial-CH,,700,0,0,,{\blur4}怠惰至极
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.44,0:00:09.63,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}阿尼亚
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.99,0:00:11.43,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}再不做作业的话
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.43,0:00:13.70,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}又要被老师骂了哦
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.84,0:00:14.82,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}知道了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.48,0:00:37.45,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}和阿尼亚玩捉迷藏
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.31,0:00:44.63,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}停电了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.81,0:00:53.85,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}有一个惊喜给邦德
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.85,0:00:55.60,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这里走这里走
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.25,0:01:02.41,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}终于找到你了 8号
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.41,0:01:04.06,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}请你去死吧
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.56,0:01:34.26,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}邦德
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.64,0:01:35.72,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}别为它哭泣了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.14,0:01:38.31,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}它走得很安详
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.97,0:01:49.52,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}什么 想和我道别？
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.86,0:01:59.90,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}阿尼亚正忙着做作业
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.90,0:02:01.34,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}没时间陪你玩
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.39,0:02:06.80,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不好
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.80,0:02:08.42,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}对不起 邦德
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.42,0:02:09.94,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}狗粮吃完后
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.94,0:02:12.09,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}忘记给你买了
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.43,0:02:15.66,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}今天劳埃德先生要很晚才回来
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.66,0:02:19.79,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}邦德的晚饭就让我用现成的食材试着做做吧
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.51,0:02:22.04,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好 我会努力的
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.04,0:02:31.21,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}邦德 晚饭做好了哦
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.92,0:02:40.12,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}邦德
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.80,0:02:45.65,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}关于狗狗不能吃的食材
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.65,0:02:48.36,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}劳埃德先生已经替我记下来了 没问题的
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.32,0:02:52.92,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}晚饭来喽
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.31,0:02:59.45,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}小心 要是惹恼了母亲可是会被做掉的
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.49,0:03:04.09,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}邦德
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.09,0:03:07.63,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}可是 它竟然嫌弃我做的饭
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.54,0:03:20.60,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}邦德 不要胡闹
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.36,0:03:23.72,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}怎么办 难道是生病了
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.84,0:03:45.04,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这不是邦德吗
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.04,0:03:45.82,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}怎么了
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.12,0:03:49.61,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}谢谢你帮忙解决了它
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.61,0:03:51.39,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}多亏了你可以早点回家了
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.95,0:03:59.63,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}邦德
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.90,0:04:01.78,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}邦德
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.67,0:04:13.02,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}狗狗
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.95,0:04:26.21,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}谢谢惠顾
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.75,0:04:29.21,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这条野狗怎么回事
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.63,0:04:33.43,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}居然接受外人的喂食
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.43,0:04:34.36,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}坏孩子
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.88,0:04:55.99,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是狗狗
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.99,0:04:57.69,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}给它画条眉毛吧
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.16,0:05:48.29,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}今晚的任务是
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.72,0:05:51.46,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}夺取玻恩公司正在研发的新型吐真剂
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.46,0:05:53.30,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}「吐露真心」的样本
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.14,0:05:56.26,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}命令同往常一样强人所难
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.26,0:05:58.46,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}收集情报的时间都没给我
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.71,0:06:00.14,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}现在就去
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.53,0:06:02.36,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}变装潜入是来不及了
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.82,0:06:04.87,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}只能强行潜入了
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.81,0:06:09.64,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}邦德 怎么会在这里
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.03,0:06:11.10,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}安静点
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.10,0:06:12.08,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}会被敌人发现的
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.57,0:06:14.36,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}话说怎么就你一个
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.60,0:06:16.09,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}约尔小姐和阿尼亚呢
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.09,0:06:18.27,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是在散步途中溜出来的吗
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.67,0:06:21.66,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}虽然不清楚情况 快回家去
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.66,0:06:23.22,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我正在工作
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.68,0:06:29.74,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}什么 想要我陪你玩吗
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.93,0:06:31.58,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我现在很忙 待会再说
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.34,0:06:35.56,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}慢着 那边是敌人老巢啊
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.79,0:06:41.28,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}在带我走没人的路？
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.56,0:06:43.86,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我不记得有训练它到这种水平
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.86,0:06:45.22,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是以前学会的吗
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.89,0:06:47.28,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}说起来
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.28,0:06:50.14,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}听说玻恩公司好像曾和「APPLE」计划有所关联
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.95,0:06:53.48,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}难道你 是知道了这个才到这来
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.95,0:06:55.68,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}来讨伐自己的 不
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.02,0:07:00.04,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}被掳走作实验体的同伴的敌人吗
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.87,0:07:03.60,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.86,0:07:05.57,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}一起完成任务吧
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.57,0:07:06.70,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}情报不足的部分
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.70,0:07:08.68,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}就靠你的鼻子吧
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.08,0:07:25.86,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这里就是研究室吗
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.13,0:07:27.77,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}到处都是保险箱啊
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.16,0:07:31.83,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}哪个是「吐露真心」啊
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.60,0:07:34.29,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}安保系统也很坚固
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.29,0:07:36.87,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}一个个确认的话可要费老大劲啊
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.16,0:07:40.08,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}回家得到什么时候了
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.76,0:07:46.16,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}怎么突然把我们叫回来啊
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.59,0:07:48.66,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}说是机器出故障了
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.13,0:07:50.82,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不妙 那些家伙回来了
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.73,0:07:53.57,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我去吸引敌人的注意
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.57,0:07:54.89,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你先回去
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.11,0:07:56.55,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}要变成持久战了
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.81,0:07:59.78,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你跑哪里去了
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.78,0:08:01.23,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}快吃饭
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.07,0:08:07.14,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}放心
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.14,0:08:08.98,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}研究员大都下班了
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.89,0:08:14.95,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}难道
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.38,0:08:18.51,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}真是的 科长那家伙
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.51,0:08:20.84,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}怎么突然把我们叫回来啊
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.12,0:08:23.20,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}说是机器出故障了
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.39,0:08:26.28,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}截止日期也提前了 太折腾人了吧
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.28,0:08:27.87,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}别抱怨了
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.87,0:08:29.47,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}因为上头的施压
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.89,0:08:32.36,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}门没锁
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.22,0:08:37.83,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这是什么
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.79,0:08:42.09,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}怪盗T
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.24,0:08:42.83,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}谁啊
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.22,0:08:44.41,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}别开玩笑
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.06,0:08:51.34,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}什么嘛 不还在吗
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.59,0:08:53.65,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}真是 谁搞的恶作剧…
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.03,0:08:58.02,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}谢谢你打开保险箱
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.80,0:08:59.77,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}帮了我大忙啊
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.32,0:09:02.21,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你…你们是什么人
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.62,0:09:03.52,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}来 来人啊
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.63,0:09:10.69,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}有一手啊
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.69,0:09:12.78,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}托你的福 任务这么顺利就完成了
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.27,0:09:17.69,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}能比计划的更早回家了
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.80,0:09:23.71,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好吃吗
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.24,0:09:27.42,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}真的是
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.42,0:09:29.95,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我可是担心得到处找你呢
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.47,0:09:38.43,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是吗
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.66,0:09:41.37,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}报了玻恩公司一箭之仇这么高兴啊
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.37,0:09:42.06,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}太好了呢
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.59,0:09:45.07,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好 回去的时候顺道去趟超市
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.07,0:09:46.83,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}给你做顿好吃的吧
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.52,0:10:05.75,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}达米安大人
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.90,0:10:08.84,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}再不起来的话点名要迟到了
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.75,0:10:17.89,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}作为点名迟到的处罚 命你去帮宿管干活
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.89,0:10:21.02,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}干完前禁止出宿舍
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.50,0:10:22.81,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}真是少见啊
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.81,0:10:24.19,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}虽说是休息日
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.19,0:10:27.03,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}堕落的生活可不优雅
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.03,0:10:28.52,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Mr.德斯蒙德
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.97,0:10:30.28,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我下次会注意的
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.40,0:10:39.12,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}达米安大人 您又学习到很晚了?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.35,0:10:41.91,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}毕竟得快点取得「星星」啊
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.09,0:10:44.00,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}努力过头了呀
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.92,0:10:46.12,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}今天好像
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.12,0:10:49.06,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}老师会带我们去看电影哦
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.28,0:10:52.38,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}说不定能看到新上映的「海底两万步」呢
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.84,0:10:55.68,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}听说回来时还能去文普森吃烤牛肉哦
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.68,0:10:57.56,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}快点干完活去和大家会合吧
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.56,0:10:58.88,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}烤牛肉
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.88,0:11:00.14,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不去
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.34,0:11:02.39,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我要在房间里学习
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.17,0:11:05.11,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}明明是难得的休息日
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.11,0:11:07.04,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我说不去就不去
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.23,0:11:08.61,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}怎么这样
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.27,0:11:10.34,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那个 老师
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.72,0:11:12.65,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}电影的话选哪部都可以吗
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.65,0:11:14.81,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我想要看「海底两万步」
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.98,0:11:17.69,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这样啊 怎么办好呢
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.10,0:11:19.42,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}就看那个吧
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.42,0:11:21.11,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我和那些家伙不一样
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.49,0:11:25.62,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那些家伙在玩的时候 我要努力向上攀登
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.08,0:11:26.92,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}达米安
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.38,0:11:29.73,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}为了不让德斯蒙德之名蒙羞
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.73,0:11:31.63,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你要继续努力
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.25,0:11:34.70,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}为了让再次得到父亲大人的夸奖
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.25,0:11:37.79,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你们
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.39,0:11:39.99,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去那边吧
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.99,0:11:42.52,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这是他一个人的惩罚
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.86,0:12:02.49,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}衣冠不整
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.49,0:12:04.43,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}在规定时间以外饮食
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.43,0:12:07.96,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}作为惩罚 命你们去帮宿管干活
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.96,0:12:09.75,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}谢谢您
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.13,0:12:16.21,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你…你们怎么在这
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.21,0:12:17.58,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}没和大家出去吗
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.58,0:12:18.35,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这是惩罚
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.35,0:12:20.07,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}赶紧干完吧
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.34,0:12:22.44,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}说了我不会去玩的
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.44,0:12:24.16,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}达米安大人脾气真倔
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.16,0:12:25.11,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}书呆子
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.55,0:12:26.52,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}算了吧
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.52,0:12:28.31,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}别跟着我这种人
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.90,0:12:30.97,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你们俩去玩吧
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.92,0:12:40.82,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}仔细一想
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.82,0:12:44.72,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这么好的天气去电影院 他们真没品味
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.72,0:12:45.66,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}就是
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.66,0:12:47.83,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}现在流行的是洗衣服
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.08,0:12:49.14,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}而且你看
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.41,0:12:55.05,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}还能玩扮演「皇帝学徒」的游戏
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.37,0:12:59.60,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}想要「星星」的话就来追我吧
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.83,0:13:02.18,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你这家伙 那个披风是我的
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.46,0:13:04.12,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}喂 你们几个
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.12,0:13:05.77,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}给我好好干活
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.97,0:13:07.22,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}优雅
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.22,0:13:10.27,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这份友情 极其地优雅
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.59,0:13:25.85,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}一副想去郊游的表情啊 少年
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.00,0:13:27.30,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}才没有这么想
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.40,0:13:32.96,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}工作中说闲话 瞎胡闹
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.96,0:13:35.30,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我要给你们新的惩罚
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.25,0:13:38.40,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你们跟着生活指导老师格林老师
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.40,0:13:40.80,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}一起去野外学习吧
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.60,0:13:47.52,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}郊游开心吧
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.45,0:13:47.67,Dial-CH,,0,1300,0,,{\blur4}要死了 要死了
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.52,0:13:49.85,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}校区内还能玩漂流
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.85,0:13:51.35,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}伊甸学园厉害吧
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.35,0:13:52.21,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}要死了啊
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.21,0:13:53.65,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}放心吧
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.65,0:13:56.44,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我以前可是海军大队的老手
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.44,0:13:59.04,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你们就放心好好享受吧
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.64,0:14:03.11,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好 就这样一路向下游的湖泊进发吧
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.11,0:14:05.03,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那地方可是很舒服的
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.70,0:14:08.16,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}适当的运动对大脑也有好处
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.16,0:14:11.50,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}光坐在桌前学习效率可不一定高哦
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.50,0:14:13.04,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这可不是适当的程度啊
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.04,0:14:14.62,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你们几个
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.62,0:14:17.63,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}左边 不使劲划的话要撞上石头了哦
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.16,0:14:22.09,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}老师
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.09,0:14:23.76,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}前面有瀑布
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.27,0:14:33.73,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}达米安大人
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.87,0:14:38.05,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}救命
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.05,0:14:39.93,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我可是德斯蒙德家的次子
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.93,0:14:41.17,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我们现在就来
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.43,0:14:42.03,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}喂 你们
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.40,0:14:45.42,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我可是艾尔曼家的继承人
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.42,0:14:47.03,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我可是埃吉伯格家的
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.32,0:14:48.24,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}至 至少
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.24,0:14:50.22,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}让达米安大人活下去
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.22,0:14:51.13,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是啊
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.13,0:14:53.69,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}请带着我们的那份心意 去实现梦想吧
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.10,0:14:54.92,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你们两个…
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.92,0:14:56.29,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}快上船
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.29,0:14:58.25,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}在我们殒命之前
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.25,0:14:59.04,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}可恶
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.62,0:15:02.25,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不好意思破坏一下气氛
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.25,0:15:04.63,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这条河用脚能够到底 水流也不快
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.49,0:15:08.35,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是因为我在划船所以才显得快
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.63,0:15:18.36,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好了
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.36,0:15:21.52,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不快点去拾柴生火的话会感冒的哦
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.12,0:15:34.42,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好暖和
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.24,0:15:37.79,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}放下心来之后感觉肚子饿了
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.79,0:15:40.29,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}反正你们衣服已经湿了 就去河里抓点鱼吧
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.77,0:15:43.25,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}没有准备三明治什么的吗
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.53,0:15:45.68,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}哪有那么高级的东西
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.68,0:15:48.18,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}既然是伊甸的学生 去就地取材吧
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.89,0:15:49.76,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}但是
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.04,0:15:53.25,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我来准备鱼线和网 其他的你们自己努力吧
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.39,0:16:59.23,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好吃
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.43,0:17:00.58,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是啊
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.58,0:17:02.25,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是吧是吧
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.25,0:17:05.06,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}文普森的烤牛肉虽然也不错
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.06,0:17:07.03,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}但还是比不过自己抓的猎物
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.23,0:17:08.16,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好吃
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.16,0:17:09.72,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}真好吃
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.72,0:17:10.97,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好吃
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.45,0:17:14.64,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我在开心什么
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.01,0:17:18.64,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我在做这种事的时候 别人都在学习
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.09,0:17:25.82,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}微风吹着不舒服吗 少年
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.91,0:17:33.11,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}摇曳的火焰和爆裂声
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.30,0:17:35.87,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}树木的簌簌声 泥土的气息
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.05,0:17:39.03,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}像这样放松大脑发发呆
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.03,0:17:40.34,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不也挺好吗
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.15,0:17:44.54,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}发呆可是成不了「皇帝学徒」的
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.44,0:17:46.42,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你知道吗
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.63,0:17:48.51,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}根据脑科学领域的最新研究
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.51,0:17:52.33,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}发呆的时候 大脑可是高度活跃的
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.86,0:17:56.53,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}据说与记忆力和创造力之类的也有关系
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.91,0:17:59.40,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}有名的创作者和运动员们
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.40,0:18:02.52,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}也都很重视发呆的时间哦
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.83,0:18:04.20,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}说不定发着呆
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.20,0:18:07.35,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}一眨眼的工夫就能拿满8颗「星星」了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.95,0:18:10.53,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}净骗人
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.37,0:18:12.24,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}发呆
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.80,0:18:19.09,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}达米安大人 感觉那样不太像是在发呆…
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.09,0:18:21.41,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这人意外地单纯啊
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.02,0:18:24.37,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.63,0:18:27.34,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}衣服也差不多干了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.34,0:18:29.59,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}步行去湖那边吧
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.05,0:18:35.24,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那湖好像被学生们叫做「星之湖」哦
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.24,0:18:36.69,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}「星星」 我要去
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.69,0:18:37.42,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}达米安大人
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.42,0:18:39.20,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}想「星星」想疯了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.76,0:18:43.52,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}露营露营露营露营 露营
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.50,0:18:45.52,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}说起来这段时间
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.74,0:18:47.99,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}借道第三国叛逃到西国的人又增多了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.99,0:18:51.61,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}南方人把他们的行为叫做「露营」
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.73,0:18:55.31,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}老师难道要把我们卖到西国吗
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.88,0:18:59.78,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}才走了两三公里 还不足以亡命哦
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.17,0:19:01.95,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}为什么要去西国啊
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.15,0:19:04.69,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是不是因为西国的点心更好吃
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.92,0:19:06.61,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}谁知道呢
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.61,0:19:08.37,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我们东国的星空
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.37,0:19:10.48,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}明明这么美丽
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.53,0:19:12.72,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}没关系
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.72,0:19:14.44,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}等到达米安大人成年
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.44,0:19:17.41,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}肯定能把东国建设得更好
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.14,0:19:20.94,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你的理想是当政治家吗
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.94,0:19:22.03,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}厉害啊
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.80,0:19:24.81,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}因为我父亲也是
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.03,0:19:26.24,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这样啊
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.47,0:19:30.72,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}有理想并且愿意为之奋斗是好事
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.91,0:19:33.52,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我的梦想是当宇航员
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.52,0:19:35.35,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这样啊 真帅
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.73,0:19:37.26,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我 我的梦想是
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.04,0:19:39.11,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}没什么梦想
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.11,0:19:40.40,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}没有啊
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.40,0:19:41.38,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那也没事
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.75,0:19:44.50,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我想吃好多好多点心
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.50,0:19:45.57,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}真不错…
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.57,0:19:46.68,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这啥梦想啊
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.06,0:19:49.34,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那你得好好想想
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.34,0:19:51.69,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}怎样才能创造那样的环境
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.69,0:19:55.21,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}怎样才能吃很多点心而不损害健康
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.84,0:19:56.72,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好麻烦
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.68,0:20:00.72,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}到了
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.16,0:20:19.26,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好厉害
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.26,0:20:22.01,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}像是整个宇宙都倒映在水里一样
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.33,0:20:23.85,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}看啊 少年
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.18,0:20:25.90,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好像能抓到星星哦
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.13,0:20:27.13,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}什么鬼
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.35,0:20:29.70,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你觉得这趟有白来吗
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.97,0:20:34.60,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.37,0:20:37.72,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我觉得很美
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.42,0:20:40.54,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}对吧
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.15,0:20:43.26,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}很美
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.16,0:20:59.28,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}宇宙可真大啊
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.51,0:21:00.63,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是啊
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.91,0:21:01.85,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那些星星
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.85,0:21:04.91,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好像撒上去的砂糖 感觉很好吃
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.52,0:21:08.94,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那都什么呀
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.94,0:21:11.76,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}达米安大人笑了
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.96,0:21:14.55,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}才没有 多嘴
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.92,0:21:17.44,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}差不多该回去了
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.74,0:21:20.30,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}话说这次是野外学习来着
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.30,0:21:21.16,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你们几个
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.16,0:21:23.05,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}记得好好写报告
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.34,0:21:27.18,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}想回去之后洗个澡马上睡觉
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.70,0:21:29.56,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}很健康嘛 少年
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.82,0:21:32.06,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}韩德森老师
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.75,0:21:35.81,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我把三人的野外学习报告带过来了
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.14,0:21:38.10,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}谢谢你 格林老师
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.50,0:21:40.64,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}他们从桎梏自己的牢笼里飞出来了吗
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.76,0:21:43.02,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}希望如此
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.10,0:21:45.83,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那就太优雅了
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.22,0:21:49.60,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我们看了很多也体验了很多 非常开心
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.86,0:21:53.12,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}但是 语文方面还得继续努力啊
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,「Little steps」
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,OP
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:49.43,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}だから
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.87,0:23:16.71,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}アナタ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.14,0:22:18.94,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}映入视野的深邃绯红
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.82,0:22:29.08,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}前方大约还有40000km
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.08,0:22:36.50,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}紧追过来的彼此的伤痕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.83,0:22:41.71,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}让迷茫的路途再添迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.71,0:22:46.09,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}不可视不可闻的唯一未来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.39,0:22:48.30,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}从背后一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:49.43,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}所以说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.43,0:22:57.94,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}今夜请让我伴你身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.06,0:23:06.86,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}只有今夜我无比认真
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.12,0:23:10.58,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}再靠过来一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.58,0:23:12.91,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}纵然我们一同祈愿的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.91,0:23:14.87,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}前路也会分岔而行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.87,0:23:16.71,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.09,0:23:22.46,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}让我们倾尽彼此的杀意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.46,0:23:25.84,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}给予对方最后一击
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.26,0:23:30.47,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}果然还是算了吧
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,

Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.55,0:22:00.92,Staff,,0,0,0,,Бұл субтитрді Моечая шығарған. Оны коммерциялық мақсатта пайдалануға болады.
